l9: $ G , u ∊ ω ∧ B = nmul a u ⇒ nmul ∅ u = ∅ $ by zero_nmul [l3]
l10: $ G , u ∊ ω ∧ B = nmul a u ⇒ B = nmul ∅ u $ by eq_trans [l4, l8]
l11: $ G , u ∊ ω ∧ B = nmul a u ⇒ B = ∅ $ by eq_trans [l10, l9]
