b6: $ G , k = nmul u b , w = suc v , w = b , i = suc u , j = ∅ ⇒ i ∈ ω $ by wcel_eq_l [b6a, b5]
b7: $ G , k = nmul u b , w = suc v , w = b , i = suc u , j = ∅ ⇒ i ∊ ω $ by wcel_welc [b6]
b8: $ G , k = nmul u b , w = suc v , w = b , i = suc u , j = ∅ ⇒ ∅ ∈ b $ by weaken [#2]
