b9: $ G , k = nmul u b , w = suc v , w = b , i = suc u , j = ∅ ⇒ j ∈ b $ by wcel_eq_l [b9a, b8]
b10: $ G , k = nmul u b , w = suc v , w = b , i = suc u , j = ∅ ⇒ j ∊ b $ by wcel_welc [b9]
