b16b: $ G , k = nmul u b , w = suc v , w = b , i = suc u , j = ∅ ⇒ nmul i b = nadd k w $ by eq_trans [b16a, b14]
b16: $ G , k = nmul u b , w = suc v , w = b , i = suc u , j = ∅ ⇒ nmul i b = z $ by eq_trans [b16b, b15]
