b20: $ G , k = nmul u b , w = suc v , w = b , i = suc u , j = ∅ ⇒ i ∊ ω ∧ j ∊ b ∧ nadd (nmul i b) j = z $ by and_intro [b7, b20a]
b21: $ G , k = nmul u b , w = suc v , w = b , i = suc u , j = ∅ ⇒ ∃ r (i ∊ ω ∧ r ∊ b ∧ nadd (nmul i b) r = z) $ by ex_intro [b20]
