lemma q3_gcd_zc {g d: set} (G: hyps g d) (x v: set):
  $ G ⇒ ∅ = x $ > $ G ⇒ v ∊ ω $ > $ G ⇒ ∃ g (g ∊ ω ∧ ndvd g x ∧ ndvd g v ∧ ∀ d (d ∊ ω → ndvd d x → ndvd d v → ndvd d g)) $
----
l1: $ G ⇒ ndvd v ∅ $ by ndvd_zero
l2: $ G ⇒ v = v $ by eq_refl
l3: $ G ⇒ ndvd v x $ by ndvd_eq [l2, #1, l1]
l4: $ G ⇒ ndvd v v $ by ndvd_refl [#2]
l5: $ G , i ∊ ω , ndvd i x , ndvd i v ⇒ ndvd i v $ by ax
l6: $ G , i ∊ ω , ndvd i x ⇒ ndvd i v → ndvd i v $ by imp_intro [l5]
l7: $ G , i ∊ ω ⇒ ndvd i x → ndvd i v → ndvd i v $ by imp_intro [l6]
l8: $ G ⇒ i ∊ ω → ndvd i x → ndvd i v → ndvd i v $ by imp_intro [l7]
l9: $ G ⇒ ∀ i (i ∊ ω → ndvd i x → ndvd i v → ndvd i v) $ by all_intro [l8]
l10: $ ∀ i (i ∊ ω → ndvd i x → ndvd i v → ndvd i v) ⟺ ∀ d (d ∊ ω → ndvd d x → ndvd d v → ndvd d v) $ by all_alpha
l11: $ G ⇒ ∀ i (i ∊ ω → ndvd i x → ndvd i v → ndvd i v) ↔ ∀ d (d ∊ ω → ndvd d x → ndvd d v → ndvd d v) $ by weaken [l10]
l12: $ G ⇒ ∀ d (d ∊ ω → ndvd d x → ndvd d v → ndvd d v) $ by bi_elim_l [l11, l9]
l13: $ G ⇒ ndvd v v ∧ ∀ d (d ∊ ω → ndvd d x → ndvd d v → ndvd d v) $ by and_intro [l4, l12]
l14: $ G ⇒ ndvd v x ∧ ndvd v v ∧ ∀ d (d ∊ ω → ndvd d x → ndvd d v → ndvd d v) $ by and_intro [l3, l13]
l15: $ G ⇒ v ∊ ω ∧ ndvd v x ∧ ndvd v v ∧ ∀ d (d ∊ ω → ndvd d x → ndvd d v → ndvd d v) $ by and_intro [#2, l14]
l16: $ G ⇒ ∃ g (g ∊ ω ∧ ndvd g x ∧ ndvd g v ∧ ∀ d (d ∊ ω → ndvd d x → ndvd d v → ndvd d g)) $ by ex_intro [l15]

lemma q3_gcd_sc {g d: set} (G: hyps g d) (x v u w: set):
  $ G ⇒ x ∊ ω $ > $ G ⇒ v ∊ ω $ > $ G ⇒ u = nmod v x $ > $ G ⇒ w ∊ ω $ > $ G ⇒ ndvd w u $ > $ G ⇒ ndvd w x $ > $ G ⇒ ∀ d (d ∊ ω → ndvd d u → ndvd d x → ndvd d w) $ > $ G ⇒ ∃ g (g ∊ ω ∧ ndvd g x ∧ ndvd g v ∧ ∀ d (d ∊ ω → ndvd d x → ndvd d v → ndvd d g)) $
----
